{
    "id":  11375,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "COB LED Strip 220V CUT TO SIZE | 560 LED/m | 16W/M | 1600Lm/M | FLIP CHIP | 50m | IP67 | Cut 10cm",
    "reference":  "SP560D16W-CW-92148-50M",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e220V COB LED Strip - 16W/M - 50 meters\u003c/strong\u003e - \u003cstrong\u003e560 LEDs/m\u003c/strong\u003e and Flip Chip technology offers superior power and lighting uniformity. \u003cstrong\u003eMade of Silicone\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003eIP67 protection\u003c/strong\u003e, suitable for indoor and outdoor installations. \u003cstrong\u003eNo power supply or rectifier cable required\u003c/strong\u003e, simplifying installation. With \u003cstrong\u003ecuts every 10cm and 10mm width\u003c/strong\u003e. Recommended to install on aluminum profile.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#2445a2;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCUT EVERY 1 METER | FULL REEL = 50M | PRICE PER METER\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#d0121a;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1 UNIT = 1 METER OF LED STRIP (SELECT THE METERS YOU NEED) MAXIMUM 50 METERS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eCOB LED Strip 220V | 560 LED/m | 50m\u0026nbsp;| FLIP CHIP | 1600Lm/m |16W/M | CRI90 |\u0026nbsp;IP67\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis COB LED strip delivering 16W per metre with Flip Chip technology and 560 LEDs/m provides continuous, dot-free lighting, ideal for projects that demand the highest light quality. Its 220V design makes it perfect for long runs, such as facades, ceilings, window displays, gardens and architectural spaces, allowing even illumination indoors and outdoors thanks to its IP67 protection against dust and water.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features and Benefits:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProfessional, Powerful Lighting:\u003c/strong\u003e Each metre contains 560 COB LEDs, providing a uniform light output with no flicker and no visible dots.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSilicone Construction\u003c/strong\u003e: The COB LED strip is made from high-quality silicone, which gives it exceptional flexibility and resistance to breakage. This material also prevents yellowing over the years, keeping it looking and performing like new.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHighly Flexible Installation:\u003c/strong\u003e As it needs no power supply or rectifier cable, the strip can be connected directly to the mains, cutting costs and simplifying the installation process. Its adhesive backing makes it easy to fix to a wide range of surfaces.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOutdoor Protection and Durability:\u003c/strong\u003e With its IP67 rating, the strip is resistant to water and dust, ideal for environments exposed to harsh conditions, such as terraces and gardens.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCut to Length and Adaptability:\u003c/strong\u003e With maximum flexibility and the option to cut every 10 cm, this strip can be adapted to bespoke designs, matching the specific lighting requirements of each project.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatible with Aluminium Profiles:\u003c/strong\u003e It is best installed on an aluminium profile to optimise heat dissipation, which extends the strip\u0027s service life and keeps it performing at its best.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWith its \u003cstrong\u003eCRI \u0026gt;90\u003c/strong\u003e colours look remarkably true to life. That makes this LED strip perfect for lighting spaces where colours need to be rendered perfectly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen installing it, to extend the service life of the LED strip we \u003cstrong\u003erecommend\u003c/strong\u003e using double-sided \u003cstrong\u003ethermal dissipation tape\u003c/strong\u003e and mounting it on an \u003cstrong\u003ealuminium profile\u003c/strong\u003e, for correct heat management of the LED strip itself.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn our website you will find signal amplifiers, thermal dissipation tape, connection accessories, 12-24V power supplies and aluminium profiles.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLED strips\u003c/strong\u003e are ideal for lighting up any corner or feature of your business or your home, thanks to their flexibility. One of their main advantages is undoubtedly the sheer versatility of uses they allow, since they can be installed in any area and fit into any corner, taking any position thanks to their adaptable linear design.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"color:#d0121a;\"\u003eThis LED reel is NOT submersible; the connection is made at one end directly to the mains, with a maximum of 50m per connection.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eUses of the\u0026nbsp;COB LED Strip 220V | 560 LED/m | 50m\u0026nbsp;| FLIP CHIP | 1600Lm/M |16W/M | CRI90 |\u0026nbsp;IP67\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn libraries\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBars\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHome\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRestaurants\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCanopies and roofs\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRetail\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAt FactorLED we guarantee that our products come with a QUALITY warranty and provide all the documentation required for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet for every LED product.\u003c/p\u003e\n",
